1. WHAT THIS PROJECT IS
-----------------------
Nuxt 4.5.2 SSG port of the company website. `npm run generate` writes a static
site to `dist/` (nitro.output.publicDir = 'dist'). The deployed copy lives in
`publish/www/` (mirror of dist). Source design files live in `src/` (new site)
and `D:/__WORKING_Project/DTL_Webiste/DTL_old/...` (old Adobe Muse site, used
only as a content reference; its 80+ .html files are ~36 real pages plus
"*50d5.html" duplicates and renamed jQuery/Muse library files).

2. ARCHITECTURE
---------------
- app/app.vue, app/layouts/default.vue (header + main + footer + modals + BackToTop)
- app/components/: SiteHeader, SiteFooter, LightboxModal, PdfModal, VideoModal,
  BangladeshMap, ProductProfiles, CatalogCard, CardPlaceholder, BackToTop
- app/composables/: useModal, useLegacyInteractions (delegated clicks: lightbox,
  video, tabs, PDF, image zoom), useSeo (canonical/OG/JSON-LD), useTheme
- app/data/: catalog.ts (2,110 profiles), productBuckets.ts, dealers.ts,
  divisionDealers.ts (290 map contacts), routeContacts.ts (182 rows),
  projects.ts (198), projectGallery.ts (37), developers.ts (506), directors.ts (9)
- app/assets/css/main.css  = verbatim copy of src/css/style.css - DO NOT EDIT
- app/assets/css/mobile-grid.css = added global mobile 2-col flex system
- app/assets/css/theme.css = dark mode overrides - edit this, not main.css
- nuxt.config.ts css order: main.css -> mobile-grid.css -> theme.css

