4. CONVENTIONS
--------------
- Page-local CSS goes in <style scoped>; shared overrides only in theme.css
  (dark mode) or mobile-grid.css (responsive). Never edit main.css.
- Dark-mode: html[data-theme='light'|'dark']; never use :global(html[...]) in a
  scoped SFC (it collapses the page); add new light-surface classes to theme.css.
- Mobile: card/stat grids become 2-up flex at <=820px (flex:1 1 45%, min-width:0).
  Long-form paragraph cards intentionally stay single column (news article cards,
  investor disclosure cards <=620px).
- All internal links = NuxtLink; assets use a leading slash; PDFs open in a new tab.
- Every page sets title/description with useSeo(...); home overrides titleTemplate.

5. RECENT WORK (Nov 2026 session)
---------------------------------
a) Site-wide mobile 2-col flex grid system -> app/assets/css/mobile-grid.css
