   instead of scrolling sideways at <=820px.

6. COMMANDS
-----------
npm run dev            # dev server
npm run generate       # static build -> dist/ (expect exit 0)
rm -rf publish/www/* && cp -r dist/. publish/www/   # mirror deployed copy
node scripts/build-catalog-data.mjs                 # regenerate catalog.ts from CSV
node scripts/build-division-data.cjs                # regenerate divisionDealers.ts
node scripts/build-sitemap.mjs                      # regenerate public/sitemap.xml

7. GOTCHAS
----------
- Windows + Git Bash: prefix commands with `export MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1` when a
  value starts with "/" (otherwise / becomes C:/Program Files/Git/).
- Chrome for verification: C:/Program Files/Google/Chrome/Application/chrome.exe
  (headless + CDP over ws from node_modules/ws). Serve dist on a local port;
  full-page screenshots of heavy pages can crash the ws client - use viewport shots.
- The old site's footer labels (Melting, Extruding, Pipes & Hollow Tubes, At A Glance)
  do not all map to pages; use the real routes instead.
- /products-furniture keeps the source's broken image path verbatim (pre-existing
  source defect); /enlisted-developer holds 506 de-duplicated companies.
- main.css and the source design are the source of truth for visuals; the changes
  above are additive content/footer/responsive work, not a redesign.
